    "excerpt": "With 120+ GWh of EV batteries reaching end-of-life globally in 2026, Asia faces a battery waste emergency. This guide covers China's new recycling regulations, Japan's closed-loop system, South Korea's EPR laws, and what SEA countries are doing about old EV batteries.",
