    "excerpt": "Embark on an unforgettable EV road trip from Bangkok to Krabi, covering 820 km through Southern Thailand. This guide details essential charging stops in Chumphon and Surat Thani, including station names, costs, and family-friendly tips to make your journey smooth and affordable.",
