    "excerpt": "FedEx, Lazada, and Grab are electrifying their fleets across Southeast Asia. Complete guide to EV fleet conversion for logistics and delivery businesses — costs, TCO analysis, charging depot setup, battery swapping, and real case studies from Singapore, Thailand, and Vietnam.",
