    "excerpt": "Retired EV batteries with 70-80% capacity can power your home for 5-10 more years. Complete guide to second-life EV battery home storage in Asia — how it works, costs, safety requirements, brands, and where to buy repurposed packs in Japan, China, Thailand, and Singapore.",
