    "title": "EV Battery Health Guide for Tropical Climates — How Heat and Humidity Affect Degradation in SEA",
    "excerpt": "Living in Southeast Asia's heat and humidity affects your EV battery differently than temperate climates. Learn how to maximize battery life with proven strategies for tropical conditions — from charging habits to thermal management.",
    "date": "2026-05-14",
    "author": "EV Charging Asia Team",
