    "excerpt": "South Korea has 100,000+ public charging stations but foreign credit cards are rejected everywhere. Here's your complete guide to charging an EV in Korea as a foreigner — which apps work, payment solutions, and road trip routes.",
    "date": "2026-05-14",
    "author": "EV Charging Asia Team",
