    "excerpt": "Raya 2026 exposed Malaysia's EV charging problems in full force: broken chargers, hours-long queues, and a network that can't keep up with 118% sales growth. Here's what went wrong and how to survive your next road trip.",
    "date": "May 13, 2026",
