    "title": "Top 5 EVs for Family Road Trips in Asia 2026",
    "excerpt": "Best EVs for family road trips across Asia in 2026 — BYD Atto 3, Tesla Model Y, MG4, NIO ET5 Touring, and XPeng G6 compared. Range, cargo space, child seat fit, charging speed, and real-world pricing across SE Asian markets.",
    "date": "2026-05-12",
